# quotes
Saída escrever: ['ABC'] code, stop.
Saída escrever: ['123['ABC']123'] code, stop.
Saída escrever: ['123\['ABC\']123'] code, stop.
Saída escrever: ['123\['ABC'\]123'] code, stop.
Saída escrever: ['123[\'ABC\']123'] code, stop.
Saída escrever: ['123\[\'ABC\'\]123'] code, stop.
Saída escrever: ['123\\ABC\\123'] code, stop.
Saída escrever: ['123\\\ABC\\\123'] code, stop.
Saída escrever: ['123\\\\ABC\\\\123'] code, stop.


